# APEX API origin the browser talks to (F16 spec §5). No trailing slash.
# Dev: the FastAPI app runs on :8001 (ARCHITECTURE.md — uvicorn ... --port 8001).
# 127.0.0.1, not localhost: Windows resolves localhost to ::1 first and the IPv6
# connection fallback adds a flat ~2s to every request against IPv4-only uvicorn.
# Prod: set the deployed API origin via Vercel env vars.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8001
